<title>USA: Core Industries Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Core Industries Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended August 31   Year Ended August 31</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	   1996	   1995</p>
<p> Sales	$62,274,000 $47,465,000  $230,157,000 $187,897,000</p>
<p> Net (loss)  4,048,000 ($3,688,000)    12,940,000    3,828,000</p>
<p> Shr net (loss)     .38	( .38)	   1.24	    .39</p>
<p> Avg Shares   10,709,000   9,809,000   10,453,000    9,809,000</p>
<p>NOTES - Results include discontinued operations, which include after-tax loss of $6.8 million or $0.70/shr in year-ago Q4 and full-year results.</p>
